#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-locosys.rst:5 84b8608f34a641158ddd17aa12c03768
msgid "LOCOSYS HAWK R1 & R2 RTK GNSS"
msgstr "LOCOSYS HAWK R1 & R2 RTK GNSS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-locosys.rst:7 947a08cac93d4a82842663b0a232b26a
msgid ""
"HAWK R1 and R2 (with compass) is a L1+L5 dual-frequency RTK centimeter-level"
" GNSS receiver designed for UAV applications. The receiver is capable of "
"concurrently tracking global civil navigation systems, including GPS, "
"GLONASS, GALILEO, BEIDOU and QZSS. It acquires both L1 and L5 signals at a "
"time while providing the centimeter-level RTK positioning accuracy."
msgstr ""
"HAWK R1 和 R2（含罗盘）是专为无人机应用设计的 L1+L5 双频 RTK 厘米级 GNSS 接收机。该接收机能够同时跟踪全球民用导航系统，包括"
" GPS、GLONASS、GALILEO、BEIDOU 和 QZSS，同时捕获 L1 和 L5 信号，提供厘米级 RTK 定位精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-locosys.rst:16
#: 3c1936480b1d4b00b3b3792e97e4899f
msgid ""
"HAWK R1 and R2 GNSS requires L1 and L5 RTCM GNSS correction data for a "
"stable RTK fix"
msgstr "HAWK R1 和 R2 GNSS 需要 L1 和 L5 RTCM GNSS 校正数据才能实现稳定的 RTK 固定"

